          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " can't",
          "start": 2722.18,
          "end": 2722.42,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " be",
          "start": 2722.42,
          "end": 2722.46,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " with",
          "start": 2722.46,
          "end": 2722.6,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " them",
          "start": 2722.6,
          "end": 2722.76,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " every",
          "start": 2722.76,
          "end": 2722.96,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " time.",
          "start": 2722.96,
          "end": 2723.36,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But God chaperones your children. You're, you're a person,",
